      ],
      "impact": "The internal LDO of the FT231XS may fight the external 3.3V regulator, causing power instability or damage.",
      "confidence": 0.85
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain multiple anomalies: USB ESD protection devices U25 and U26 short different USB data lines together, the SC16IS752 UARTs U13 and U14 are misconfigured for I2C mode while SDA is grounded, and the FT231XS U21 has its internal LDO output tied to the external 3.3V rail."
